142
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:08,520
Increïble.

143
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:08,560
Ah!

144
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:10,220
Les muntanyes aquestes són...

145
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:12,240
